M.E. Donnaruma (med2062@ultb.isc.rit.edu) wrote:
:     The other day I was playing NH3.1 and killed off a red dragon 3
: squares from a neutral altar. Now I had 18/20 strength and tried to pick
: up the monster but couldn't. I dropped everything (including armor) and
: still couldn't budge the corpse. So I came up with this idea:

How about changing teleport spell/scroll into two:
teleportation
teleport other

If you have teleport control you could use teleport other to teleport
certain items to specific spot.  Of course this wouldn't work on
creatures with teleport control.  This might change the balance of
things.  If you want to move a corpse that you can't lift with a 25
strength then you should kill it on the altar.

Perhaps a new item that you can't lift: a fork lift.

Perhaps another solution to this problem: a telekenesis ring.
